{"ref":"BDB, אֲחִימַן","hw":"אֲחִימַן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִימַן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my brother is a gift</em>? so Thes; cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَنٌّ</span> <strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a son of Anak <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:22\" href=\"/Numbers.13.22\">Nu 13:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:10\" href=\"/Judges.1.10\">Ju 1:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִימָן֨</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:14\" href=\"/Joshua.15.14\">Jos 15:14</a>. < <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִימָן</span>, v. Norzi<sup>Nu 13:22</sup> GFM<sup>Ju 1:10</sup> (after Ven.<sup>1</sup> Mich).<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Levite, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִימָ֑ן</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.17\">1 Ch 9:17</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲחִימַ֫עַץ","prev":"BDB, אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ"}